# the MIDI map (0.15.7): the USB & MIDI settings page's fourth knob sends MIDI out's parts where a sampler plays them as it comes (GM, Model:Samples,
# MPC Sample, SP-404); kept with the settings across power-off
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
turn SELECT 1
wait 100
expect fxpage 24
expect midimap 0
spin K4 1
wait 200
expect midimap 1
shot midimap.png
spin K4 5
wait 100
expect midimap 3
spin K4 -1
wait 100
expect midimap 2
tap HOME
wait 300
tap PLAY
wait 5000
reboot
wait 3000
expect midimap 2
